  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of agricultural export enabling infrastructure and extension services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Domestic production and processing capacities are insufficient to cater for the rising demand for food in Nepal. Therefore, the government of Nepal developed its Agriculture Development Strategy in order to lift trade-limiting infrastructure constraints in cold and dry storage and improve quality treatment, assessment, sanitary and phyto-sanitary testing. The scope of this D2B project is to study the feasibility of such measures.</narrative>
  </description>
